      "status": 200,
      "body": "# MasterClass\n\n> MasterClass is the streaming platform where anyone can learn from the world's best across a wide range of subjects.\n\nMasterClass offers online classes taught by world-renowned instructors across categories including Arts & Entertainment, Business, Design & Style, Sports & Gaming, Writing, Food, Music, Science & Tech, Home & Lifestyle, Community & Government, and Wellness.\n\n## Key Features\n\n- Video lessons from 200+ world-class instructors\n- Downloadable workbooks and supplementary materials\n- Available on web, iOS, Android, Apple TV, Roku, and Amazon Fire TV\n- New classes added regularly\n- Standard, Plus, and Premium membership plans\n\n## Public Pages\n\n- [Homepage](https://www.masterclass.com/): Browse all classes and instructors\n- [Categories](https://www.masterclass.com/categories): Explore classes by category\n- [Articles](https://www.masterclass.com/articles): Educational articles and guides\n- [Plans](https://www.masterclass.com/checkout): Standard, Plus, and Premium membership plans and pricing\n- [Certificates](https://www.masterclass.com/certificates): Learn high-impact skills from industry leaders and stand out with MasterClass Certificates\n- [MasterClass at Work](https://www.masterclass.com/for-business): Flexible training solutions for teams featuring insights from the world's top experts, empowering employees from the field to the boardroom.\n- [MasterClass On Call](https://oncall.masterclass.com/): Elevate your skills and thrive in the moments that matter most with roleplay and coaching from the AI of the world's best.\n- [MasterClass Executive](https://www.masterclass.com/executive): AI-native, cohort-based program that helps professionals build real proof of capability to advance their careers. Completable in 12-16 weeks on your own time.\n\n## About\n\nMasterClass was founded by David Rogier. It provides access to lessons from instructors who are the best in the world at what they do, including Gordon Ramsay (cooking), Neil deGrasse Tyson (scientific thinking), Serena Williams (tennis), Martin Scorsese (filmmaking), and many more.\n\n## Contact\n\n- Website: https://www.masterclass.com\n- Help Center: https://www.masterclass.com/help-center\n- Twitter: https://twitter.com/masterclass\n- Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/masterclass/\n",
      "url": "https://www.masterclass.com/llms.txt"
    },
