      "status": 404,
      "body": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta content=\"website\" property=\"og:type\" />\n    <meta content=\"MasterClass\" property=\"og:site_name\" />\n    <title>MasterClass</title>\n    <meta content=\"Access Genius\" name=\"description\" />\n    <meta content=\"Entertainment,Education\" name=\"keywords\" />\n    <meta content=\"MasterClass Online Classes\" property=\"og:title\" />\n    <meta content=\"MasterClass gives you access to genius through online classes from the best in the world.\" property=\"og:description\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n    <link href=\"/error-page.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\">\n  </head>\n\n  <body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <a href=\"/\"><img src=\"/logo.svg\" /></a>\n      <h2>Oops, this page doesn't exist</h2>\n      <p>But did you know...</p>\n      <p id=\"story\"></p>\n      <h4>Go back to the homepage to keep learning.</h4>\n      <a href=\"/\"><button>masterclass.com</button></a>\n    </div>\n    <script>\n      var stories = [\n        'Picasso\\u2019s first word was \\u201cpiz,\\u201d short of \\u201cl\\u00e1piz\\u201d the Spanish word for \\u201cpencil.\\u201d His father Ruiz, an artist and art professor, gave him a formal education in art starting from the age of 7. By 13, Ruiz vowed to give up painting as he felt that Pablo had surpassed him.',\n        'Julia Child solidified her passion for cooking after setting out to see the world \\u201clooking for adventure,\\u201d working for the OSS, the forerunner of the CIA.',\n        'Ludwig van Beethoven began losing his hearing when he was 28, eventually living completely deaf. Nevertheless, in his later years, he wrote not only the 9th Symphony, but composed both \\u201cMissa Solemnis\\u201d and \\u201cFidelio.\\u201d',\n        'Nelson Mandela learned Afrikaans, the language of his oppressors, while imprisoned in South Africa. It allowed him to communicate with wardens, eventually winning some of their loyalty.',\n        'World renowned Mexican artist Frida Kahlo painted her first self-portrait while in a full body cast for three months. She\\u2019d survived a terrible bus accident that changed the trajectory of her art.'\n      ];\n      document.getElementById('story').textContent = stories[Math.floor(Math.random() * stories.length)];\n    </script>\n  </body>\n</html>\n",
