ed him to communicate with wardens, eventually winning some of their loyalty.',\n        'World renowned Mexican artist Frida Kahlo painted her first self-portrait while in a full body cast for three months. She\\u2019d survived a terrible bus accident that changed the trajectory of her art.'\n      ];\n      document.getElementById('story').textContent = stories[Math.floor(Math.random() * stories.length)];\n    </script>\n  </body>\n</html>\n",
